#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SoundTouch"
msgstr "Instalação do SoundTouch"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:76
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tarball expands to 'soundtouch' instead of the expected "
"'soundtouch-&soundtouch-version;'"
msgstr ""
"O tarball se expande para 'soundtouch' em vez do esperado "
"'soundtouch-&soundtouch-version;'"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>SoundTouch</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>SoundTouch</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <command>bootstrap</command> command below fails if the ACLOCAL "
"environment variable is set as specified in <xref linkend=\"xorg7\"/>.  If "
"it is used, ACLOCAL needs to be unset for this package and then reset for "
"other packages."
msgstr ""
"O comando <command>bootstrap</command> abaixo falha se a variável de "
"ambiente ACLOCAL estiver configurada conforme especificado em <xref "
"linkend=\"xorg7\"/>. Se ele for usado, ACLOCAL precisa estar desconfigurada "
"para esse pacote e então reconfigurada para outros pacotes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:94
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./bootstrap &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/soundtouch-&soundtouch-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./bootstrap &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/soundtouch-&soundtouch-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install </userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install </userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/soundtouch.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-openmp</option>: This switch adds support for running the "
"algorithms in parallel across several processor cores using OpenMP "
"implementation provided by GCC."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-openmp</option>: Essa chave adiciona suporte para execução "
"de algoritmos em paralelo em vários elementos de processamento do "
"processador usando a implementação OpenMP fornecida pela GCC."

